              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "टैक्सी — ṭaiksī — \"a taxi\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हमने स्टेशन से टैक्सी ली। hamne sṭeśan se ṭaiksī lī. We took a taxi from the station."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
